Investors can now use Claude + Super Carl’s MCP to find fresh founders emerging from major tech companies.

Not just by searching the internet.

By searching relationship graphs, warm intro paths, and real-world reachability.

Example prompt:

“Use Super Carl to find people who recently became founders after leaving a well-known tech company.

I’m looking for ‘fresh founders’ — people who changed their title to Founder (or Co-founder / CEO) at a new company within roughly the last 6–12 months, and who came from a notable tech company beforehand (think the big platforms, top AI labs, or well-funded scale-ups).”

And then it ranks:
• Who’s most relevant
• Who your network can actually reach
